le": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 880], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "c2dbf9620ad98cf3fba452da1171ef3d7485bde8a8ed10924cf54cb82e312b82", "role": "user", "sequence": 3}, {"character_range": [0, 443], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "bb90455d5d1f47abba5e7b7f4662384b7cfbdec7601d735b5c488d40b687671e", "role": "user", "sequence": 5}, {"character_range": [0, 17], "next_role": null, "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "763c285bac51f157b4fe8b610819bcbc5b66397952eb59c0cf9ffc1a3fd4fe18", "role": "user", "sequence": 7}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "先重新讲讲这道题。\n\n这道题我倒觉得没问题，但我有问题的点在哪里呢？第一个点就是我不理解它这个“上侧”指的是法线朝上。\n\n这题我的做法是用高斯积分去做：把盖子补上，然后用高斯积分去做 dV，然后再减掉一个盖子。这个盖子的底 z = 0、z = 1（底 z 是个常数），所以只剩下积分区域 (xz - 1)dxdy。然后这个积分区域 dxdy，我可以把 z 转换成 x² + y²，dxdy 就转换成一个圆，积分区域是 0 到 2π dθ，r 是从 0 到 1 的一个圆。\n\n能这么算吗？还是该怎么入手？"}